  {
   "id": "the-transference-273790@1",
   "gameId": "the-transference-273790",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-31T18:55:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone! 👋",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I've just released an update for The Transference aimed at fixing an issue reported by some players involving an enemy's behavior and animations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This issue, reported by two players on the Steam discussion forums, could cause the enemy to become stuck during its animations, preventing players from interacting with certain puzzles and progressing further. It seems to have occurred only when the enemy appearance frequency was set to \"Normal Frequency\" in the game settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Although I haven't been able to reproduce the issue on my system, I've implemented changes to try to prevent it from happening again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A huge thank you to the players who reported the issue and shared their save files and gameplay footage. Your help has been incredibly valuable!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you're still experiencing this issue after updating, please let me know in the Steam discussions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks for your support and patience! ❤️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
